          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብረ ከብካበ ለወልዱ ፡ ም ፳፪ ቍ ፩",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእንተ ዘከመ ይደሉ ውሂበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጸባሕት ለቄሣር ። ቍ ፲፭",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእንተ ሰዱቃውያን ወትንሣ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 38,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኤ ሙታን ። ቍ ፳፫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 39,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእንተ ዓቢይ ትእዛዘ እግዚአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 40,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሔር ። ቍ ፴፬",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንድሞችን መምከር እንዲገባ ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለ ክርስቲያን ይቅርታ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለ ባሮች ምሳሌና ዕዳን ስለ መክፈል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጌታ ከኢየሩሳሌም እንደ ሄደ ።",
